<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">conviction-spike</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Conviction Spike</ansi> spell projects raw belief as a focused kinetic
spike of force, striking a single target with considerable precision.
A reliable attack for the practiced caster — fast to cast and reliable
against physically resilient foes.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast conviction-spike [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Elemental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 4
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 50
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — armor and toughness blunt the impact
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Direct damage to a single target

